// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
//
// crucible.manifest as a resource, for a Windows compiler other than MSVC.
// MSVC's linker writes a manifest of its own and merges this one into it when
// CMake hands it the file; MinGW's has no such step, so it goes in here.
// 1 is CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID and 24 is RT_MANIFEST.
1 24 "crucible.manifest"
